     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archibald_Henderson"
    ],
    "description": "A Marine-led force under Archibald Henderson attacked Seminole and Black Seminole forces in Florida. Henderson was promoted brevet brigadier general for the campaign, the first Marine general.\n\n**Read more:** [Second Seminole War — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Second_Seminole_War)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons ([file page](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archibald_Henderson)).*"
   }
  },
  {
