    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMX-1"
    ],
    "description": "Marine Helicopter Squadron One was formed at Quantico to develop **vertical envelopment**: landing troops by helicopter from ships, a concept the Corps proved in Korea. HMX-1 today also flies the President as *Marine One*.\n\n**Read more:** [HMX-1 — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HMX-1)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
  {
