    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holland_Smith"
    ],
    "description": "Considered the father of modern US amphibious warfare. He trained Army and Marine divisions in amphibious techniques before the war, and commanded the V Amphibious Corps and then the Fleet Marine Force, Pacific, from the Gilberts to Iwo Jima.\n\n**Read more:** [Holland Smith — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holland_Smith)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
  {
