    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Khafji"
    ],
    "description": "Iraq's only major ground offensive of the Gulf War seized the Saudi town of Khafji. Two Marine reconnaissance teams hid in the town calling in fire, while Saudi and Qatari forces, supported by Marines and coalition aircraft, retook it.\n\n**Read more:** [Battle of Khafji — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Khafji)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
  {
