    ],
    "description": "Marines and sailors stormed the forts on Ganghwa Island after Korean batteries fired on an American survey. Six Marines received the **Medal of Honor**, the first for actions in a foreign war.\n\n**Read more:** [United States expedition to Korea — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_expedition_to_Korea)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
