    ],
    "description": "In 2022, 247 years after the Corps' founding, Langley was promoted to general and took command of United States Africa Command.\n\n**Read more:** [Michael Langley — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Langley)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
