    ],
    "description": "The \"Greatest of all Leathernecks\", the first Marine to command an Army division in combat. As 13th Commandant (1920–1929), Lejeune set the Corps on its course toward **amphibious warfare** as its central mission.\n\n**Read more:** [John A. Lejeune — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_A._Lejeune)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
