    ],
    "description": "The 2nd Raider Battalion under **Evans Carlson**, with Major James Roosevelt, the President's son, came ashore from submarines to destroy the Japanese garrison on Butaritari. Nine Raiders accidentally left behind were captured and executed.\n\n**Read more:** [Makin Island raid — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raid_on_Makin_Island)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
