    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayaguez_incident"
    ],
    "description": "After the Khmer Rouge seized the US container ship SS *Mayaguez*, Marines assaulted Koh Tang island under heavy fire. The crew was released, but 41 Americans died; three Marines left behind on the island were later killed. They are the last names on the Vietnam Veterans Memorial.\n\n**Read more:** [Mayaguez incident — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayaguez_incident)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
  },
