    ],
    "description": "Commanding the 1st Raider Battalion, Edson moved among his lines through the night of 13–14 September, rallying the defenders of the ridge south of Henderson Field. He received the **Medal of Honor**.\n\n**Read more:** [Merritt A. Edson — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Merritt_A._Edson)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
