    ],
    "description": "Marine squadrons on Midway Atoll attacked the Japanese carrier force in obsolete aircraft and suffered heavy losses, while Marine anti-aircraft gunners defended the island. The battle turned the tide of the Pacific War.\n\n**Read more:** [Battle of Midway — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Midway)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
   }
