    "description": "The hero of Derna. Tradition holds that Prince Hamet Karamanli presented O'Bannon with a Mameluke sword, the model for the sword Marine officers have carried since 1826.\n\n**Read more:** [Presley O'Bannon — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Presley_O%27Bannon)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
