    "description": "When Sandino's forces besieged a small Marine and Nicaraguan National Guard garrison, five Marine DH-4 biplanes made one of the first organized **dive-bombing attacks** in support of ground troops, breaking the attack.\n\n**Read more:** [Battle of Ocotal — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Ocotal)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
