    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oliver_P._Smith"
    ],
    "description": "Commanding the 1st Marine Division at Chosin, Smith concentrated his regiments against orders to scatter them, saving the division. As the breakout from Hagaru-ri began, he told reporters: *\"Retreat, hell! We're not retreating, we're just advancing in a different direction.\"*\n\n**Read more:** [Oliver P. Smith — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oliver_P._Smith)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
