    ],
    "description": "A battalion of Continental Marines under Nicholas joined Washington's army for the winter campaign of Trenton and Princeton: one of the first times Marines fought alongside the Continental Army in the field.\n\n**Read more:** [Battle of Princeton — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Princeton)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
