    "description": "The first offensive of the American Expeditionary Forces as an independent army. The 4th Marine Brigade attacked with the 2nd Division and took its objectives quickly as the German salient collapsed.\n\n**Read more:** [Battle of Saint-Mihiel — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Saint-Mihiel)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
