    ],
    "description": "Major Smedley Butler led the assault on the Caco stronghold of Fort Rivière in Haiti, receiving his **second Medal of Honor** (the first was for Veracruz). Retired as a major general, he later denounced the interventions he had fought in, in *War Is a Racket* (1935).\n\n**Read more:** [Smedley Butler — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smedley_Butler)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (from the article above).*"
