    "description": "Defense Secretary Ash Carter opened every military occupation, including Marine infantry, to women from 2016. The first women graduated from the Infantry Officer Course in 2017.\n\n**Read more:** [Women in the United States Marines — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Women_in_the_United_States_Marine_Corps)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons ([file page](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ash_Carter)).*"
