    ],
    "description": "Four years after Lejeune's birthday order, Marines held the first formal **Marine Corps birthday ball**. No record of its proceedings survives. *(The day is not recorded; the moment marks the year.)*\n\n**Read more:** [Marine Corps birthday ball — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marine_Corps_birthday_ball)"
