    "description": "The Marine Corps' **250th birthday**, marked by Marines around the world after a year of anniversary events, with celebrations in Philadelphia, where the Corps was raised, and the Commandant's ball in Washington.\n\n**Read more:** [250th anniversary of the United States Marine Corps — marines.mil](https://www.marines.mil/News/Messages/Messages-Display/Article/4000116/250th-anniversary-of-the-united-states-marine-corps/)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (a 250th birthday cake ceremony, Marine Corps Installations Pacific; U.S. Marine Corps photo).*"
