    "sources": [
     "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raymond_G._Davis"
    ],
    "description": "Lt. Col. **Raymond G. Davis** led the 1st Battalion, 7th Marines, eight miles across the mountains at night in a snowstorm, over three ridges, to relieve Fox Company and hold Toktong Pass until both regiments from Yudam-ni had passed through. He brought out all his wounded, including 22 stretcher cases, and received the Medal of Honor.\n\n**Read more:** [Raymond G. Davis — Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raymond_G._Davis)\n\n*Image: Wikimedia Commons (Lt. Col. Ray Davis, 1952; U.S. Marine Corps photo).*"
